  "decision": [
    "Keep acceptance-quality, accept/non-target dataflow, draft-depth, and target-cost as separate mechanisms; never add their optimistic bounds.",
    "C1 acceptance quality clears entry because hipEngine accepted-draft ratio is 15.33% versus Laurent 80.51%; C2 acceptance does not because hipEngine already exceeds Laurent.",
    "Accept/non-target dataflow is the only cost mechanism whose optimistic bound clears every primary cell. It advances as the Z3 structural candidate, but the bound does not identify a safe implementation.",
